      "message": "test: Cover pruned node with empty chainstate\n\nDelete the chainstate directory of a pruned node whose genesis block\nhas been pruned. Check that startup then fails with an error asking\nfor a reindex, and that the suggested reindex recovers the node.\n\nWithout the previous commit, the node never finishes starting up and\nthis test times out.",
